msgid ""
"\n"
"Convert business inquiries that have ended up in the Helpdesk pipeline by "
"mistake,\n"
"or generate a ticket from a business inquiry\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ປ່ຽນການສອບຖາມທາງທຸລະກິດທີ່ເຂົ້າໄປຢູ່ໃນຂະບວນການຂອງ Helpdesk ໂດຍຄວາມຜິດພາດ,\n"
